    <string name="settings_backup_desc">Export all your cloud connections to one file, or import them back.</string>
    <string name="home_import">Import from backup</string>
    <string name="backup_title">Backup and restore</string>
    <string name="backup_intro">Connect each cloud once, then export a backup file. Import it later, even on a new phone, to get back into all your clouds without typing emails, passwords or 2FA codes again.</string>
    <string name="backup_warn">The file holds the keys to your clouds and vaults. It opens only with three things together: your first password, your second password and the Backup Key shown when you export. The Backup Key is not stored in the file or in this app. If you lose any one of the three, the file can never be opened, and nobody can recover it for you.</string>
    <string name="backup_note_sessions">Some logins can expire over time (for example Mega with 2FA, or Terabox). If a cloud asks you to sign in again, add it again. Sync tasks are not included in the backup.</string>
